  "bio": "Marcos Martins, a masterful tattoo artist hailing from Viana do Castelo, Portugal, is renowned for his exceptional skill in black & gray and realism styles. Clients consistently praise his dedication to maintaining a high standard of cleanliness in his studio, Skinlab Tattoos, creating a safe and hygienic environment for all his tattoo sessions. Whether you're a local or coming from afar, Marcos ensures that your ink is both impeccably detailed and applied with the utmost care for a lasting impression.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Viana Do Castelo, Portugal\n\n✖️Tattoo artist from Portugal\n✖️Owner of Skinlab Tattoos\n✖️Barcelos/Viana do Castelo\n✖️For appointments: info@skinlab.com.pt",
